flowchart TB
  accTitle: From user input to an isolated task and a verified result
  accDescr: Illustrative flexible-task path. Host-owned Telegram or HTTP entrypoints verify identity and build a trusted request. Harness Bridge uses OpenShell Docker to run existing DSH with an optional Skill and configured tools. Owned cleanup precedes structured results; the host separately authorizes delivery. Flow groups are stages, not deployment trust boundaries. No warm pool is implemented.

  subgraph input["1 · INPUT — host-owned entrypoints"]
    direction LR
    TG@{ icon: "simple-icons:telegram", form: "rounded", label: "Telegram message<br/>Summarize this text", h: 52 }
    HTTP@{ icon: "lucide:webhook", form: "rounded", label: "HTTP / external event<br/>Host-provided adapter", h: 52 }
    Auth@{ icon: "lucide:shield-check", form: "rounded", label: "Verify actor + group<br/>Apply current permissions", h: 52 }
    Request@{ icon: "lucide:file-json", form: "rounded", label: "Trusted task<br/>IDs + prompt + optional Skill", h: 52 }
    TG --> Auth
    HTTP --> Auth
    Auth --> Request
  end

  subgraph execution["2 · EXECUTION — existing OpenShell + DSH"]
    direction LR
    Bridge@{ icon: "lucide:workflow", form: "rounded", label: "Harness Bridge<br/>Authorize + bound + track", h: 52 }
    Docker@{ icon: "simple-icons:docker", form: "rounded", label: "Fresh Docker sandbox<br/>Upload Skill + DSH patch", h: 52 }
    DSH@{ icon: "lucide:bot", form: "rounded", label: "Existing DSH Harness<br/>Reason + run configured tools", h: 52 }
    Model@{ icon: "lucide:sparkles", form: "rounded", label: "External model provider<br/>Policy-approved access", h: 52 }
    Bridge -->|native CLI| Docker
    Docker -->|prompt on stdin| DSH
    DSH <-->|via native policy| Model
  end

  subgraph output["3 · OUTPUT — cleanup, evidence, then host delivery"]
    direction LR
    Cleanup@{ icon: "lucide:circle-check", form: "rounded", label: "Owned cleanup<br/>Stop + delete + verify absence", h: 52 }
    Result@{ icon: "lucide:file-check-2", form: "rounded", label: "Result object<br/>status + evidence + success output", h: 52 }
    Reply@{ icon: "lucide:message-square-text", form: "rounded", label: "Host-authorized reply<br/>Summary in the original chat", h: 52 }
    Cleanup -->|verified or blocked| Result
    Result -->|approved success only| Reply
  end

  input -->|trusted request to execute| execution
  execution -->|finish / fail / cancel| output

